---
import "../../styles/animations.css";
---

<figure class="an-wrap">
  <svg class="an ca" viewBox="0 0 480 270" role="img" aria-label="When a cached key expires only one caller refills it from the database"><rect class="nd " x="16" y="40" width="100" height="60" rx="12"/><image href="/images/ruvio-mark-128.png" x="26" y="49" width="22" height="22"/><text class="b" x="77.0" y="65" text-anchor="middle">App 1</text><rect class="nd " x="16" y="110" width="100" height="60" rx="12"/><image href="/images/ruvio-mark-128.png" x="26" y="119" width="22" height="22"/><text class="b" x="77.0" y="135" text-anchor="middle">App 2</text><rect class="nd " x="190" y="60" width="110" height="100" rx="12"/><image href="/images/ruvio-mark-128.png" x="200" y="69" width="22" height="22"/><text class="b" x="256.0" y="85" text-anchor="middle">Cache</text><rect class="nd " x="380" y="75" width="84" height="70" rx="12"/><image href="/images/ruvio-mark-128.png" x="390" y="84" width="22" height="22"/><text class="b" x="433.0" y="100" text-anchor="middle">DB</text><path class="ln" d="M116 70 L190 100"/><path class="ln" d="M116 140 L190 120"/><path class="ln" d="M300 110 L380 110"/><g class="ca-w0"><text class="b" x="245" y="124" text-anchor="middle">v1</text><text class="sm" x="245" y="146" text-anchor="middle" style="fill:var(--ok)">fresh</text></g><g class="ca-w2"><text class="b" x="245" y="124" text-anchor="middle" style="fill:var(--bad)">v1</text><text class="sm" x="245" y="146" text-anchor="middle" style="fill:var(--bad)">expired</text></g><g class="ca-w3"><text class="b" x="245" y="124" text-anchor="middle" style="fill:var(--bad)">v1</text><text class="sm" x="245" y="146" text-anchor="middle" style="fill:var(--c2)">refilling</text></g><g class="ca-w4"><text class="b" x="245" y="124" text-anchor="middle">v2</text><text class="sm" x="245" y="146" text-anchor="middle" style="fill:var(--ok)">fresh</text></g><g class="ca-w5"><text class="b" x="245" y="124" text-anchor="middle">v2</text><text class="sm" x="245" y="146" text-anchor="middle" style="fill:var(--ok)">fresh</text></g><g class="ca-w8"><circle class="pk" cx="116" cy="70" r="5" fill="var(--ok)" style="--dx:74px;--dy:30px;animation-delay:0s;animation-duration:1.2s!important;"/><circle class="pk" cx="116" cy="140" r="5" fill="var(--ok)" style="--dx:74px;--dy:-20px;animation-delay:0.6s;animation-duration:1.2s!important;"/></g><g class="ca-w5"><circle class="pk" cx="116" cy="70" r="5" fill="var(--ok)" style="--dx:74px;--dy:30px;animation-delay:0s;animation-duration:1.2s!important;"/><circle class="pk" cx="116" cy="140" r="5" fill="var(--ok)" style="--dx:74px;--dy:-20px;animation-delay:0.6s;animation-duration:1.2s!important;"/></g><g class="ca-w6"><circle class="pk" cx="116" cy="70" r="5" fill="var(--c1)" style="--dx:74px;--dy:30px;animation-delay:0s;animation-duration:1.2s!important;"/><circle class="pk" cx="116" cy="140" r="5" fill="var(--c1)" style="--dx:74px;--dy:-20px;animation-delay:0.3s;animation-duration:1.2s!important;"/></g><g class="ca-w3"><circle class="pk" cx="300" cy="110" r="5" fill="var(--c2)" style="--dx:80px;--dy:0px;animation-delay:0s;animation-duration:1.4s!important;"/></g><g class="ca-w4"><circle class="pk" cx="380" cy="110" r="5" fill="var(--c2)" style="--dx:-80px;--dy:0px;animation-delay:0s;animation-duration:1.4s!important;"/></g><g class="ca-w3"><text class="sm m" x="74" y="196" text-anchor="middle">App 2 waits or</text><text class="sm m" x="74" y="212" text-anchor="middle">gets the stale copy</text></g><rect class="cap" x="16" y="226" width="448" height="38" rx="10"/><g class="ca-w0"><text x="240.0" y="250" text-anchor="middle">FILLGET: cache hit, served from memory.</text></g><g class="ca-w9"><text x="240.0" y="250" text-anchor="middle" style="fill:var(--bad)">Key expired: only one caller refills it from the DB.</text></g><g class="ca-w4"><text x="240.0" y="250" text-anchor="middle">The DB is hit once, not once per caller.</text></g><g class="ca-w5 an-fin"><text x="240.0" y="250" text-anchor="middle" style="fill:var(--ok)">Cache fresh again: a stampede avoided.</text></g></svg>
  <figcaption><b>Caches without stampedes</b>When a hot key expires, one caller refills it while the others wait or get the stale copy.</figcaption>
</figure>
